  "operative_text": "Section 1 (N.D.C.C. 62.1-03-01(1)): Unless otherwise prohibited by law, an individual may carry a handgun if: [b.] The handgun is unloaded and secured and between the hours of one hour after sunset and one hour before sunrise."
